WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.040
It was like the Galapagos.

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:06.685
The animals were so unfamiliar with the with humans that jaguars would walk out on the beach and there'd be...

00:00:06.685 --> 00:00:08.045
You know, the animals just don't care.

00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:08.925
They don't know what you are.

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:09.485
They don't care.

00:00:09.485 --> 00:00:10.685
Jaguar doesn't care.

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:11.600
Tapers and capybara and caiman and just just incredible amounts of life.

